WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:03,020
So, you must obey all my orders

2
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:06,020
Otherwise, I will drive you out

3
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:08,020
If you do anything inappropriate to me

4
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:10,020
Once discovered by me

5
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:12,020
I will kill you without mercy

6
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:15,390
So cold-blooded

7
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:17,460
Even if there is a reason to be on guard

8
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:19,460
But if I can put it mildly,

9
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:21,460
I'll be a little touched, I guess.

10
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:24,060
you live in that house

11
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:26,100
But say it beforehand

12
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:28,100
There are surveillance cameras in every corner of the whole house

13
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:31,100
So you must always be under my supervision

14
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:33,100
no privacy at all

15
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:35,420
The door is a specially made door

16
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:37,420
The material of the pen door is thinner

17
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:39,450
It cannot be opened by human power

18
00:00:39,450 --> 00:00:41,450
If it were in my hands

19
00:00:41,450 --> 00:00:43,450
Only during the time period I allow

20
00:00:43,450 --> 00:00:45,450
to let you out

21
00:00:45,450 --> 00:00:47,450
if that makes any sense to you

22
00:00:47,450 --> 00:00:49,450
You can leave now
